<title>BELARUS: Belarus monthly inflation up 5.0 pct in May vs 4.3.</title>
<headline>Belarus monthly inflation up 5.0 pct in May vs 4.3.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monthly inflation in Belarus accelerated to 5.0 percent in May from 4.3 percent in April,</p>
<p>when the rate almost doubled, the Statistics Ministry said.</p>
<p> BELARUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES  May 97    Apr 97    May 96</p>
<p> month/month pct change	  +5.0	+4.3	+0.6</p>
<p> year/year pct change	   +64.7     +57.9     +48.9</p>
<p>--Larisa Sayenko, Minsk Newsroom +375-017-227-3594</p>
</text>
